Package: hsync-server
Version: __VERSION__
Architecture: __ARCH__
Maintainer: Alberto Basso <17047798+albertsdk@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/albertsdk/hsync-server
Description: HSYNC - file synchronization server
  hsync-server is the central HTTP/WebSocket server of the HSYNC sync
  network. It manages buckets (shared directories), member accounts and
  per-account tokens, serves file upload/download with delta transfer,
  and pushes live events to connected clients over WebSocket.
  .
  Runs as a single-process uvicorn service under a dedicated system
  user, with configuration in /etc/hsync-server/hsync-server.conf.
Depends: adduser, systemd
